le.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIHM0ogKEICAgID28ICWMQ\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv.tactile\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0x753314cdf8deb3f3"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["0","8445116601126007795"],null,null,[null,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQyOElDVzRRRRAB"]],"CIHM0ogKEICAgID28ICWMQ",1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["平日中午來用餐，內用人不多只有2到3組客人，但外送一直絡繹不絕，感覺生意還不錯。\n店員很親切，用餐環境也很舒適乾淨。附有防疫隔板，讓人覺得更安心。\n\n這次點了鬼匠泡菜和鬼匠大盛換蒜味湯底。\n\n兩款湯底都算是蠻重口味的，口味還不錯。\n麵體出乎我意料地非常美味，有日式拉麵的口感。\n溏心蛋也很好吃，調味以及烹煮得很剛好。\n配菜和叉燒則非常的台式。叉燒肉很好吃但很像控肉飯的調味，很想點碗白飯來配（和湯體及拉麵不太搭）。\n下次想點點看雪花牛，或許味道會更搭。\n\n整體來說是偏台式的拉麵，美味度、價格、份量綜合評比起來性價比蠻高的。\n雪花牛單價較高，但目前店家有第二碗半價的活動（忘記是否內用限定），如果點兩碗還蠻划算的。\n會想再訪試試看其他口味。",null,[0,73]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8832285607152344282/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXlPRWxEVnpSUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8832285607152344282/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXlPRWxEVnpSUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8832285607152344282/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXlPRWxEVnpSUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8832285607152344282/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXlPRWxEVnpSUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8832285607152344282/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXlPRWxEVnpSUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8832285607152344282/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXlPRWxEVnpSUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,9838,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQyOElDVzRRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x753314cdf8deb3f3!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID28ICW4QE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?po